Modifications by GEMBA EOOD (2026) — the complete list
-------------------------------------------------------
  1. Every identifier UniswapV2* renamed GembaSwap* (contracts, interfaces,
     libraries, revert-string prefixes), and file names to match.
  2. The LP token's ERC-20 name and symbol: 'Uniswap V2' / 'UNI-V2' became
     'GembaSwap V2' / 'GSWAP-V2' (core/GembaSwapERC20.sol).
  3. The npm imports (@uniswap/v2-core, @uniswap/lib) replaced by relative imports
     of the copies in this directory (periphery/GembaSwapRouter02.sol,
     periphery/libraries/GembaSwapLibrary.sol).
  4. The pair init-code hash in GembaSwapLibrary.pairFor() recomputed for the
     GembaSwapPair bytecode compiled from this tree:
       0xb154cd520d99f29f2d52a8c4b7b5236bd8a368ae9030110bf24a28b28b19d83f
     (contracts/foundry.toml pins the compiler settings that produce it; the test
     test_LpToken_GembaNamed_And_InitCodeHashMatches fails if it drifts).
  5. A GPL-3.0-or-later SPDX line and an attribution header in every file.
